# 01_camera: delta3 corridor. Flashlight, fast view sweeps, the double door opening, running through it.
map game/delta3
at 0 god
at 0 notarget
at 1 setviewpos 2976 -1000 -376 90
at 2 give all
impulse 3 2
impulse 40 16
move 30 90 yaw=60
move 90 150 yaw=-120
move 150 180 yaw=120 pitch=-40
move 180 210 pitch=40
at 190 trigger mal_func_door_23
move 240 330 forward=127 run
end 340
capture 0 340 every=10 fps=60
capture 100 107
capture 260 265
